ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa263: FACE_SURFACE whose bounds list is (EDGE_LOOP('loop_listed_as_bound')) — the loop sits directly in a list ISO 10303-42 declares as a set of FACE_BOUNDs; the wrapper level (and its orientation flag) is absent. Disc of radius 5 on a plane at z=0; the loop chain below the defect is complete and every entity is referenced */
